# Book Picks — fix broken canonical/hreflang URLs (2026-06-09)
# Book pages declare canonical /books/<slug> (and legends/* link there), but
# that path 404'd. 301 it to the live books-<slug> page, where all the page's
# own relative "More from" links already resolve. Covers EN + zh/es/fr/it/de.
# NOTE: pages still self-declare canonical /books/<slug>; flip those tags to
# /books-<slug> in a follow-up so canonical resolves 200 instead of via 301.
